# Review ownership.
#
# The ruleset keeps `required_approving_review_count` at 0, so this file does not
# block a merge: GitHub only auto-requests the owners below as reviewers. It still
# records who owns the gates themselves.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner>...   (last matching pattern wins)

# CI definitions, PR gates and the branch rules themselves must not be changed
# by the person the gate is meant to stop.  This is a tripwire, not a merge
# block: the ruleset keeps required_approving_review_count at 0.
/.github/    @ChalkCalliope

# The executable oracles are part of the gate too; a red check must not be
# fixed by editing/removing the assertion.
/tests/      @ChalkCalliope

# The engineering contract the gates implement.
/AGENTS.md   @ChalkCalliope
